# DM grid maps -- ~1 MB of ASCII each, regenerated in one line
# (dm_influence_map + macos.write_grid_file) at the top of either script.
# The committed decks reference them by name, so run the example or the demo
# once in this directory before loading a deck by hand.
dm2_flat.txt
dm2_poked.txt
dm2_piston.txt
demo2_flat.txt

# transient decks emitted by the non-vacuity / counterexample branches
v2_qw_test.in
v2_qw_ref.in
demo2_qw_test.in
demo2_qw_ref.in

# engine stdout + batch transcripts
fort.6
*.log
